	(text "12 MHz IF (7 to 17 MHz used) from the second mixer, or 0.1 to 15 MHz straight from the input.  58 dB of gain less the attenuator, in 50 ohm."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 31.75 0)
